{"id": "DemzhkKSHdO", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "One playful word from Mahadev, and the Devi decided to change her very colour 🤍\n\nFrom the Shiva Purana (Vayaviya Samhita, chapter 24 and 25): Mahadev spoke of her dark complexion in jest, and it hurt her. He told her it was only a jest, but her resolve was firm. She left her ornaments, took up tapas on the Himalaya, and worshipped the Shivling with forest flowers. A huge tiger leapt at her and froze where it stood. She showed it mercy, and it became the guardian of her tapovan.\n\nNavdurga, Day 8, Part 1 of 2. Part 2: what happened when Brahma came 👀 Told as Tholu Bommalata, Andhra's leather shadow puppets 🪔\n\nSource: Shiva Purana, Vayaviya Samhita, chapters 24 and 25\n\nSend this to the one who holds on to every word you say 🙈\n\n#maamahagauri #mahagauri #mahadev #parvati #tholubommalata", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1792263607, "like_count": 14833, "comment_count": 35, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1755267155769795a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 53.046, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMDyi0HSAuG-H9siFHAjC59pB_YWpnaRl05VxbpJZki_-G4aABgE_Elrkf0iLo8FEs1Kae4mMqfbOlYBRWO4CkGKIbhdeU3qfmyh8I.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Adq4pLC3j5tUsxh_MB1kvdYDrDHe-5P_iAsnMHmDHqpFvbt9jp9BF4PWSAFcHpuyGr58Dszqcqn4XJwYq5P0RhKZ&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=-BLQnaPQV_cQ7kNvwE2-kAU&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=hkmuUwikddcQ-FIYGuu-sw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTPcRm1eIP8QP0S0AkX02sLCJD-Io4QFtbB8UHahtaCtw&oe=6AF4168E", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 53.046, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers